# No AI Tool Attribution

Never include any text that attributes code or commits to AI tools. This includes:

- `Made-with: Cursor`
- `Made with Cursor`
- `Generated by Cursor`
- `Co-authored-by: cursor` (or any AI tool name)
- Any similar "made with / powered by / generated by [AI tool]" phrases

This applies to:
- Commit messages and trailers
- Code comments
- README files
- PR descriptions
- Any other written output
